{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"retrieve-then-rerank","title":"检索-重排两阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/foundations/retrieve-then-rerank","wordCount":1570,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"bi-vs-cross-encoder","title":"双编码器与交叉编码器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/foundations/bi-vs-cross-encoder","wordCount":1482,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"relevance-signals","title":"相关性信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/foundations/relevance-signals","wordCount":1558,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>要理解重排序，先得理解它存在的位置：它从来不是孤立模型，而是漏斗里的第二级。本章打地基，三篇文档依次回答三个递进的问题——为什么需要两阶段、两阶段各自该用什么样的编码器、以及「相关」这件事到底由哪些信号决定。</p>\n<p>第一篇「检索-重排两阶段」确立全局心智模型：第一阶段追求高召回、可扩展、廉价，第二阶段追求高精度、可接受地昂贵。它解释了候选数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 这个贯穿全 hub 的旋钮，以及为什么先粗后精的漏斗在算力上是必然选择。第二篇「双编码器与交叉编码器」把上一篇的「廉价」与「精准」落到具体架构：双编码器把查询和文档分开编码、可预计算、用于召回；交叉编码器把两者拼在一起联合编码、不可预计算、用于重排。这一对取舍是整个 hub 后续所有模型的分类轴。第三篇「相关性信号」把视角从架构转向语义：重排器在打分时实际利用了词项匹配、语义接近、结构与行为等多层信号，理解这些信号能解释为什么纯语义模型有时反而输给混合方案。</p>\n<p>读完本章，你会拥有阅读后续三章所需的全部坐标系：架构轴（双 vs 交叉）、规模轴（召回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> vs 重排 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>）、信号轴（词项 vs 语义 vs 行为）。第二章「重排器」会沿架构轴展开具体模型，第三章「训练」会讲这些模型怎么学会用好这些信号，第四章「实践」会把规模轴上的取舍变成可量化的延迟与成本决策。</p>\n"}